OL,3,GNEWSA'Unknown' spy thriller shortlisted
OL,4,Afor annual award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA best-selling author has described the
OL,7,Fspy in his latest book as "unlike any I
OL,8,Fhave come across before".
OL,10,FOxford-born multimillion-selling writer
OL,11,Fand historian Ben Macintyre says he
OL,12,Fused never-before-seen material to
OL,13,Fcraft the Cold War thriller Redwood -
OL,14,Fthe "unknown spy" whose work "possibly
OL,15,Faverted nuclear Armageddon".
OL,17,FIt has made the 2026 Waterstones
OL,18,Fshortlist for Book of the Year, which
OL,19,Fhighlights the books that booksellers
OL,20,Fhave most enjoyed recommending to
OL,21,Freaders.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
