OL,5,
OL,6,FEven though Macintyre has written
OL,7,Fextensively about espionage, including
OL,8,Fbestseller Operation Mincemeat, he says
OL,9,Fhe "had not realised just how important
OL,10,FRedwood was" before writing the book.
